dent that i can make significant contributions to enron in this area . i would like to thank you again for giving me this opportunity to come to enron for this interview . i am looking forward to having the opportunity to work in enron . sincerely yours jacob - - - vince . j . kaminski @ enron . com wrote : > jacob , > > it was nice meeting you . did take by any chance > my pen ? if not , i apologize . > > vince > do you yahoo ! ? get email at your own domain with yahoo ! mail . http : / / personal . mail . yahoo . com /",0.0,,Enron.csv,,,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,duplicate
