f discussion , it looks like wednesdays over lunch is the best time . i will have heather find a large conference room . the meeting will start at 11 : 30 and hopefully be concluded by 1 : 30 . location will follow on monday . thanks bob please pass this memo to people that should be included . just have them let heather know who will be attending so she can order food . thanks",0.0,,Enron.csv,,,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,duplicate
