nd i were actually working off an old version of fgt ' s letter , not the one they ultimately approved and used . since you are out of the office , i ' ve taken the liberty of forwarding it to carl without you reviewing it first , since i know we want to mail this out soon . carl , michelle advised me that eol ' s lawyer had approved the previous version so i assume they will want to review this one as well . let me know if there are any concerns . thanks ! susan ( x 30596 )",0.0,,Enron.csv,,,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,duplicate
